{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12298","headline":"晚春永宁墅小园独坐寄上王相公 · 钱起","name":"晚春永宁墅小园独坐寄上王相公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东阁一何静，莺声落日愁。\n夔龙暂爲别，昏旦思兼秋。\n蕙草出篱外，花枝寄竹幽。\n上方传雅颂，七夕让风流。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12298.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12298","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}